+*   **Leaf Nodes:** The bit mask encodes the leaf origin using $3 \times 20$ bits. Other bits encode additional information, such as whether the voxels are compressed or quantized [S1]. Leaf nodes also contain a separate bit mask indicating which voxels are active, and a raw pointer to the voxel data itself [S1].
 
